#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Shared store + waiters queue for the tools layer (stdlib only, POSIX file locks).

Layout under <store_dir> (round_config.RoundConfig.store_dir()):
  info.jsonl          append-only log, one JSON object per line (sorted keys). Kinds: info_request, info_answer,
                      info_invalidate, cost. Never rewritten.
  index.json          derived: store_key -> latest valid info_answer. Rebuildable from info.jsonl at any time.
  inflight/<key>.lock waiters-queue marker held by the one process fetching <key>.

Keys: sha256(norm(question) | scope | epoch), first 16 hex. epoch = sha256 over the bytes of the round's epoch
files, so editing any of them changes every key and old answers are simply never hit again.
Timing values (lease, waiter timeout, poll interval, max age) are passed in by callers from round_config params.
"""
